<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UAL started as hold. [CORRECTED 14:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UAL started as hold. [CORRECTED 14:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects recommendation in headline and text from &quot;buy&quot; to &quot;hold&quot;.)</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it initiated coverage of UAL Corp as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- UAL gained 7/8 to 72-3/4.</p>
</text>
